{"src":"en","tgt":"de","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":189600,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"de","src":"en","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":9413.890461,"text":"In 1990, it was added to the list of World Heritage Sites in Danger due to the threat of desert sands."},{"kind":"text","t":9999.940335000001,"text":"Im Jahr 1990 wurde es aufgrund der Bedrohung durch Wüstensand in die Liste der in Gefahr befindlichen Welterbestätten aufgenommen."},{"kind":"audio","t":10689.184132,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10690.539559,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10691.876486000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10693.400536000001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10695.134881,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":10696.846226,"samples":32600,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"input","t":18854.767706,"text":"If you have watched the movie National Treasure, you may think a treasure map was written on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"text","t":19484.621099,"text":"Wenn Sie den Film „National Treasure“ gesehen haben, könnten Sie denken, dass auf der Rückseite der Unabhängigkeitserklärung eine Schatzkarte verfasst wurde."},{"kind":"audio","t":20181.318836,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":100,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20182.592511,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20184.150952,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20185.778355,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20187.400577999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":20188.777495,"samples":27863,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1000},{"kind":"input","t":26835.238651,"text":"Children are placed in foster care for a wide variety of reasons that range from neglect to abuse."},{"kind":"text","t":27374.487574,"text":"Kinder kommen aus den unterschiedlichsten Gründen in Pflegefamilien, die von Vernachlässigung bis hin zu Misshandlung reichen."},{"kind":"audio","t":27902.089562999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27903.468260999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27905.103423999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27906.737246999997,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":27907.812678,"samples":21343,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":640},{"kind":"input","t":29883.481739,"text":"and even to extortion."},{"kind":"text","t":30021.241776,"text":"und sogar zur Erpressung."},{"kind":"audio","t":30149.324518999998,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":120,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":30149.521703,"samples":947,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":40780.960954999995,"text":"Chocamo Valley, Chile's premier climbing destination, known as the Yosemite of South America, with a variety of granite big walls and crags."},{"kind":"text","t":41486.0151,"text":"Das Chocamo-Tal, Chiles führende Kletterdestination und als das „Yosemite Südamerikas“ bezeichnet, zeichnet sich durch zahlreiche große Granitwände und Felsen aus."},{"kind":"audio","t":42294.710546,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":110,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42296.033233,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42297.622185,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42299.295518,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42300.989241999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42302.597925,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42304.269638,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":42304.475942,"samples":7467,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":150},{"kind":"input","t":46517.355018,"text":"Accepted were Aristotle's views on all matters of science, including physiology."},{"kind":"text","t":46968.109823,"text":"Aristoteles’ Ansichten zu allen wissenschaftlichen Themen, einschließlich der Physiologie, wurden anerkannt."},{"kind":"audio","t":47456.481374999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47457.932973999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47459.549205999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":47461.209809,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":47461.662649,"samples":8526,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":310},{"kind":"input","t":54281.577368,"text":"If you're not used to driving on country roads, keep your wits about you. Steep grades, narrow lanes, and sharp curves predominate."},{"kind":"text","t":54732.499607,"text":"Wenn Sie es nicht gewohnt sind, auf Landstraßen zu fahren, bleiben Sie wachsam. Steile Hänge, enge Pfade und scharfe Kurven dominieren."},{"kind":"audio","t":55244.796159,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55246.35297,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55247.903851999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55248.023274,"samples":5628,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":60},{"kind":"audio","t":55249.867521,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":80,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55251.529615,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":55252.003204,"samples":12761,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":430},{"kind":"input","t":67476.541801,"text":"The presence of the true invisible team, Larson and LaFasto, 1989, page 109, is also a unique component of a virtual team."},{"kind":"text","t":68214.883124,"text":"Die Präsenz des „wahren unsichtbaren Teams“ – Larson und LaFasto, 1989, Seite 109 – ist ebenfalls ein einzigartiger Bestandteil eines virtuellen Teams."},{"kind":"audio","t":69264.207565,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69265.663054,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69267.30433700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69268.83759800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69270.56838200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69272.109653,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69273.760356,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69275.38587900001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":69275.9437,"samples":12873,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":410},{"kind":"input","t":73017.964533,"text":"After the accident occurred, Gibson was transported to a hospital but died shortly after."},{"kind":"text","t":73338.933856,"text":"Nach dem Unfall wurde Gibson in ein Krankenhaus gebracht, starb jedoch kurz darauf."},{"kind":"audio","t":73785.815646,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":310,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73787.344867,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73788.99455,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73789.693364,"samples":16495,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":590},{"kind":"input","t":82777.092617,"text":"Many German baked goods feature almonds, hazelnuts, and other tree nuts. Popular cakes often pair particularly well with a cup of strong coffee."},{"kind":"text","t":83214.086719,"text":"Viele deutsche Backwaren enthalten Mandeln, Haselnüsse und andere Nussfrüchte. Beliebte Kuchen passen oft besonders gut zu einer Tasse starken Kaffees."},{"kind":"audio","t":83783.813444,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83785.169651,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83786.897486,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":83787.038468,"samples":1448,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":83789.299044,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83790.63911,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":83791.82959400001,"samples":24464,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":860},{"kind":"input","t":90135.505827,"text":"Needless to say, if you know a Romance language, it will be easier for you to learn Portuguese."},{"kind":"text","t":90581.889077,"text":"Selbstverständlich wird es für Sie einfacher sein, Portugiesisch zu lernen, wenn Sie eine romanische Sprache kennen."},{"kind":"audio","t":91123.60095200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91125.135882,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91126.738664,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1150},{"kind":"audio","t":91128.41370800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91128.75020400001,"samples":11312,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":340},{"kind":"input","t":97829.044072,"text":"The pyramid sound and light show is one of the most interesting things in the area for kids."},{"kind":"text","t":98290.752798,"text":"Die Pyramiden-Beleuchtungs- und Lichtshow gehört zu den interessantesten Attraktionen in der Gegend für Kinder."},{"kind":"audio","t":98800.8205,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1320},{"kind":"audio","t":98802.84243100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":110,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98804.220688,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":98805.841201,"samples":32099,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1280},{"kind":"input","t":103720.23503200001,"text":"Traffic flow is the study of the movement of individual drivers and vehicles between two points."},{"kind":"text","t":104133.99536,"text":"Verkehrsfluss ist die Erforschung der Bewegung einzelner Fahrer und Fahrzeuge zwischen zwei Punkten."},{"kind":"audio","t":104590.260257,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104591.80573800001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104593.562693,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":104594.33033900001,"samples":20674,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":750},{"kind":"input","t":106588.52999800001,"text":"and the interactions they make with one another."},{"kind":"text","t":106865.613845,"text":"sowie die Wechselwirkungen, die sie miteinander haben."},{"kind":"audio","t":107112.758033,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":107113.97255800001,"samples":28253,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1100},{"kind":"input","t":114661.820303,"text":"Australia's Mitchell Gowrie finished 11th in the men's standing Super G Chet's"},{"kind":"text","t":115079.34166600001,"text":"Australiens Mitchell Gowrie belegte den 11. Platz im Herren-Super-G von Chet’s."},{"kind":"audio","t":115475.659295,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":280,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115477.139345,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115477.350519,"samples":8024,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":180},{"kind":"audio","t":115479.14985500001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":170,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":115479.802798,"samples":15436,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":540},{"kind":"input","t":121625.37157500001,"text":"competitor Ulrich Joklin finished 16th in the men's sitting Super G."},{"kind":"text","t":122070.138353,"text":"Der Konkurrent Ulrich Joklin belegte den 16. Platz im Herren-Sitzend-Super-G."},{"kind":"audio","t":122422.89050200001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122424.233038,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1150},{"kind":"audio","t":122424.349451,"samples":1616,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":122426.050615,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":122426.35742100001,"samples":11256,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":310},{"kind":"input","t":128617.37731200001,"text":"As referenced, independent studies suggest that Nepalese UN peacekeeping battalion unknowingly brought"},{"kind":"text","t":129165.83016200001,"text":"Wie bereits erwähnt, deuten unabhängige Studien darauf hin, dass das nepalesische UN-Friedenstruppenbataillon unbewusst"},{"kind":"audio","t":129756.12045700001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":170,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129757.587627,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129759.168588,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129760.83142100001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":129761.952464,"samples":24408,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":900},{"kind":"input","t":136525.853864,"text":"Soon after the outbreak of hostilities, Britain initiated a naval blockade of Germany."},{"kind":"text","t":136986.29383500002,"text":"Kurz nach Ausbruch der Feindseligkeiten leitete Großbritannien eine Seeblockade gegen Deutschland ein."},{"kind":"audio","t":137510.777256,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137512.174714,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137513.751315,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137515.607712,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":137515.74762500002,"samples":6854,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":170},{"kind":"input","t":145653.09125,"text":"It also attacked anything that entered the water. Even a giant dinosaur such as T-Rex would be no match for it."},{"kind":"text","t":146033.253426,"text":"Es griff auch alles an, das ins Wasser eindrang. Selbst ein riesiger Dinosaurier wie der T-Rex wäre ihm nicht gewachsen."},{"kind":"audio","t":146434.353501,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146435.686768,"samples":29647,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1100},{"kind":"audio","t":146517.948282,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146519.659066,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":146521.36166,"samples":29201,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1160},{"kind":"input","t":155027.316752,"text":"The use of video recording has led to important discoveries in the interpretation of microexpressions."},{"kind":"text","t":155500.236302,"text":"Der Einsatz von Videoaufnahmen hat zu wichtigen Erkenntnissen bei der Interpretation von Mikroausdrücken geführt."},{"kind":"audio","t":156298.34384000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156299.85363,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156301.490713,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156303.116835,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":156303.487853,"samples":9919,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":210},{"kind":"input","t":159387.940498,"text":"facial movements which last a few milliseconds."},{"kind":"text","t":159702.536005,"text":"Gesichtsbewegungen, die nur wenige Millisekunden dauern."},{"kind":"audio","t":159997.48995800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159998.986758,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":159999.278994,"samples":9696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":300},{"kind":"input","t":167437.726883,"text":"The announcement was made after Trump had a phone conversation with Turkish President Recep Tayyip Erdogan."},{"kind":"text","t":167898.139754,"text":"Die Ankündigung wurde nach einem Telefonat Trumps mit dem türkischen Präsidenten Recep Tayyip Erdogan gemacht."},{"kind":"audio","t":168406.67504600002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168408.15051500002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168409.799388,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168411.40908,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":168411.546863,"samples":4625,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":140},{"kind":"input","t":174923.876546,"text":"These are sometimes crowded family beaches with a good range of shops aligning the shore."},{"kind":"text","t":175368.193325,"text":"Das sind manchmal überfüllte Familienstrände mit einer Vielzahl von Läden entlang der Küste."},{"kind":"audio","t":175808.599895,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175813.884561,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175819.141926,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":175820.993663,"samples":13430,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":490},{"kind":"input","t":177078.679795,"text":"I just want to get safe."},{"kind":"text","t":177245.042339,"text":"Ich möchte einfach nur in Sicherheit sein."},{"kind":"audio","t":177445.70308900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":50,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":177446.320341,"samples":16551,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":540},{"kind":"input","t":188439.962255,"text":"Most of the smaller islands are independent nations or associated with France and known as luxury beach resorts."},{"kind":"text","t":189015.126278,"text":"Die meisten der kleineren Inseln sind unabhängige Staaten oder mit Frankreich assoziiert und gelten als luxuriöse Strandresorts."},{"kind":"audio","t":189661.602877,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":60,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189662.84606100002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189664.46720400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189666.044965,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189667.83368100002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":189668.074486,"samples":5015,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":180},{"kind":"close","t":199706.04198900002,"code":1005}]}